Task
You are given a string S.
Your task is to find out if the string S contains: alphanumeric characters, alphabetical characters, digits, lowercase and uppercase characters.

Solution
if __name__ == '__main__':
    s = input()
    print (s.isalnum())
    print (s.isalpha())
    print (s.isdigit())
    print (s.islower())
    print (s.isupper())
   
